d 'MVARDLURT_MULTIVARIATE': module to implement the multivariate ARDL unit root test proposed by Sam, McNown, Goh and Goh 
d
d  mvardlurt_multivariate implements the multivariate ARDL unit
d root test proposed by Sam, McNown, Goh and Goh (2024). This test 
d   extends the standard ADF regression by including lagged levels
d of multiple covariates to improve power, especially when   
d cointegration exists. 
d
d KW: ARDL
d KW: unit root
d KW: cointegration
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260913
d
d Author:  Yusuf Toyin Yusuf,  Kwara State University
d Support: email  YUSUF.YUSUF@@KWASU.EDU.NG
d
f mvardlurt_multivariate.ado
f mvardlurt_multivariate_bootstrap.ado
f mvardlurt_multivariate_diag.ado
f mvardlurt_multivariate_graph.ado
f mvardlurt_multivariate.sthlp
